      en: ["Established during the Qin Dynasty (221–206 BC)", "Birthplace of statesman Zhou Enlai (1898–1976)", "Home to Hongze Lake, the fourth largest freshwater lake in China", "Total area is approximately 10,030 square kilometers", "Designated as a UNESCO Creative City of Gastronomy in 2021", "Population of the prefecture-level city is around 4.5 million"],
